  "version": "0.9.9",
  "notes": "<!-- dsh-notes:zh -->\n# DSH Studio v0.9.9\n\n## 新功能\n\n- Harness `0.1.2-rc.1` 现在可以在 Studio 的内嵌窗口中完成鉴权并启动，无须关闭上游的登录保护。\n\n## 变更与安全\n\n- Studio 界面改由本机回环来源提供，并保留同站导航；回环请求中的 Cookie 头受到大小限制。\n- 保持 `0.1.1-rc.2` 为内置基线，升级或降级仍须经过独立安装和真实 Profile 启动检查。\n\n## 修复与打磨\n\n- 兼容新旧两代 Studio 集成客户端，修复新版 Harness 内嵌界面的登录问题。\n- 统一主界面与常用控件的文字层级、按钮按下反馈和触控行为；减少字号与控件尺寸的零散偏差。\n- 修复全新检出时未生成 `dist/` 导致 Rust 检查无法运行的问题，并在 CI 中验证。\n- 更新三平台回归测试，实际安装并启动 `0.1.2-rc.1`。`0.1.5-rc.2` 当前的上游依赖缺少发布版本，本次不宣称该版本已验证可用。\n\n## 安装与已知限制\n\n- 可覆盖安装或使用应用内更新。Lite 首次运行时下载依赖；Full 附带离线运行时。\n- 所选 Harness 版本仍需通过独立启动验证；失败不会替换当前运行时或删除 Profile、会话。\n\n## 验证\n\n- Windows 实测 `0.1.2-rc.1` 独立安装与真实 Profile 启动；本地前端构建、lint、269 项前端测试、51 项打包脚本测试和 Rust 工作区测试通过。\n- 发布流水线在 Linux、Windows、macOS 构建并检查安装包。macOS 尚无实体设备验证。\n\n<!-- dsh-notes:en -->\n# DSH Studio v0.9.9\n\n## Changes and security\n\n- Serve the Studio shell from a loopback origin so Harness `0.1.2-rc.1` authenticates in the embedded window without disabling upstream cookie protection.\n- Preserve same-site navigation, bound the loopback cookie header, and keep `0.1.1-rc.2` as the bundled baseline.\n\n## Fixes and polish\n\n- Support both generations of the Studio integration client.\n- Align the main UI's typography and button feedback, including touch behavior and reduced-motion support.\n- Allow Rust-only checks on a clean checkout before Vite has generated `dist/`, with CI coverage for that path.\n- Test a real isolated installation and Profile boot of Harness `0.1.2-rc.1` on the CI platforms. The `0.1.5-rc.2` dependency set currently references an unpublished npm version and is not claimed as verified.\n\n## Installation and limitations\n\n- Upgrade in place or use the in-app updater. Full includes offline dependencies; Lite downloads them when needed.\n- A selected Harness release still has to pass isolated startup verification; a failed candidate leaves the existing runtime, Profile, and sessions intact.\n\n## Verification\n\n- Windows isolated install and real Profile boot of `0.1.2-rc.1` passed. The local frontend build, lint, 269 frontend tests, 51 packaging tests, and Rust workspace tests passed.\n- The release workflow builds and checks Linux, Windows, and macOS artifacts. No physical macOS device was available for validation.\n\n<!-- dsh-notes:end -->",
